+"""Focused PR32 native-scroll consumers over explicitly inert transport.
+
+The five native 1380x709 PNG crops are unedited. Their unavailable outer frame
+is declared gray padding at the original coordinates, never a reconstructed
+native full screenshot. OCR rows replay a separately archived, actual offline
+RapidOCR read of those padded images; they are not ROOT's original OCR output.
+The optional first-counter boxes replay the distinct ROOT diagnosis metadata.
+
+Manual-scroll Worker initialization uses frame_worker/ready_fixture; its state
+publisher is a declared same-stage 1-1 adapter. The two normal methods use the
+actual Worker constructor and publish, with current supervisor reviews passed
+through ordinary decide; their Guide opening and review facts are declared.
+Image reading, transport, process/window
+probes and initial manual ownership are fixtures. ManualPhase constructors,
+mailbox, Worker guards, GuardedSubmission, Entry lease, immutable receipts and
+postconditions run unchanged. No controller, real game input or live capture.
+"""
